[TITLE]
API-19: pressure values in psi with specific gravity 2
A PRV, an emitter, pressure-driven demand and a pressure control, all set in psi.
API-19_sg1.inp is the same network with specific gravity 1.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elev  Demand
 J1  0     0
 J2  0     100      ; 100 gpm, pressure driven
 J3  0     0

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID  Head
 R1  250

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J2  J3  1000    8     100    0      Open

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting  Mloss
 V1  J1  J2  12    PRV   40       0     ; 40 psi downstream

[EMITTERS]
;Junction  Coefficient
 J2        10           ; gpm per psi^0.5

[CONTROLS]
 LINK P2 CLOSED IF NODE J2 BELOW 30     ; 30 psi

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[REPORT]
 Summary  No

[OPTIONS]
 Units              GPM
 Pressure           PSI
 Headloss           H-W
 Specific Gravity   2
 Demand Model       PDA
 Minimum Pressure   0
 Required Pressure  20                  ; psi
 Pressure Exponent  0.5

[END]
